--
-- BEGINNER (pick A: re-case)
--   Section 3 pick A: the buildup explorer opened on the teaching buildup at the
--   capstone window, so all six answers showed on its default state. The
--   capstone moves to the OBODO-4 buildup, delivered as a file and opened in the
--   new Your test mode with the constants the brief states.
--   RE-KEY horner_k_md (expected 82.49005478363101, tol 0.05)
--       -> obodo_horner_k_md 'OBODO-4 Horner permeability' mD, expected 40.34569148966339, tol 0.05
--   RE-KEY horner_skin (expected 6.075741352818642, tol 0.005)
--       -> obodo_horner_skin 'OBODO-4 skin from the one-hour pressure' -, expected 2.782737573136271, tol 0.005
